    "date, time, matchup and venue.",
    "",
    "Times are LOCAL to the venue, with the venue's UTC offset stated per fixture so a",
    "human can verify a row against cplt20.com without doing timezone arithmetic.",
    "scripts/import-cricket-fixtures.mjs computes the UTC instant from the three.",
    "Every Caribbean venue here is UTC-4 year-round EXCEPT Sabina Park in Jamaica,",
    "which is UTC-5 and does not observe DST — the single most likely thing to get",
    "wrong in this file.",
    "",
    "The four playoff slots carry deliberately placeholder-shaped team names so that",
    "isPlaceholderTeam() matches them and the UI disables picks until the",
    "participants are known. Rename them through the admin game editor once the",
    "league table settles.",
    "",
    "sourceId is the import idempotency key, paired with leagueId in the partial",
    "unique index games_league_source_unique. It must be stable across re-imports."
